WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.571
- I love it.

00:00:01.571 --> 00:00:02.729
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:02.729 --> 00:00:03.612
Oh my gosh.

00:00:03.612 --> 00:00:06.049
Wait, can I see the back?

00:00:06.049 --> 00:00:07.138
Oh my gosh.

00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:08.781
(Lisette laughs)
(audience cheering)

00:00:08.781 --> 00:00:11.429
That's beautiful.
- Thank you.

00:00:11.429 --> 00:00:13.355
Thank you so much.
- How gorgeous are you?

00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:14.353
- Thank you so much. (laughs)

00:00:14.353 --> 00:00:16.290
- And I see her, like,
at the crack of dawn,

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.280
before hair and makeup

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.433
and she still looks as gorgeous as this.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:19.770
- All right, you know what?

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.235
I can't hear you right now, ma'am.

00:00:21.235 --> 00:00:22.770
(laughs)

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.690
You probably look the same.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.130
So, wait, so what impressed you,

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.390
Congratulations, first of all.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.160
So excited for you for this series.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.590
- Thank you.
(audience cheering)

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.477
- [Kelly] So cool.
- Thank you.

00:00:31.477 --> 00:00:33.720
- And what, were you, like, I mean,

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:34.950
I know you had to have been excited,

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.170
but what impressed you about
working with Catherine?

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.640
'Cause this is, like,
one of the greats, right?

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.473
So, you're-
- Absolutely

00:00:39.473 --> 00:00:40.560
- [Kelly] Getting to show
up and work with her.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.150
- I mean, how could I
even choose one thing?

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.320
Like it's impossible.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.340
Truly.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:46.140
I think like one of the best things

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:47.880
about working with Catherine was

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.270
that she allowed me the
space to play, like with her.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.160
And I think like as a,
you know, young actor

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:54.810
I was really nervous to like

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:57.900
get started and to, you
know, she's such a star.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:58.733
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:58.733 --> 00:00:59.910
- But she was always so kind

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.100
and you welcomed me with open
arms since the beginning.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.100
- I remember that being on this big set

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.570
for the first time where you have

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.700
so much responsibility-

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.740
- [Lisette] And pressure.
- This is our star.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.710
And she is every inch
of that inside and out.

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.750
I mean, she really is an amazing talent,

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:19.620
but she's just has a wonderful
center and work ethic.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.110
And I saw a little bit of myself in her

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:24.720
and sometimes I forget my lines

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:25.931
because I was watching her act.

00:01:25.931 --> 00:01:26.764
- Oh, know. (laughs)

00:01:26.764 --> 00:01:28.913
- [Kelly] Oh, that means
you're doing a great job.

00:01:29.805 --> 00:01:30.960
- Oh, that would be my line.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:31.793
Ok.

00:01:31.793 --> 00:01:32.670
But no, it was just,

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:35.040
- That means you're nailing it.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.147
So Lisette you're kind of taking
over for Nick Cage, right?

00:01:38.147 --> 00:01:39.630
In the National Treasure series.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.280
So, I mean, this's a huge franchise.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.480
So tell us about your character.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.670
- Yeah, so my character Jess Valenzuela,

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:48.300
she is a really smart,
determined young lady

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.100
who's living in Baton Rouge

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.630
kind of at the standstill in her life

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.830
after her mother passes away

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.140
that's where we pick up in the story.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:58.770
She, one day gets this,
you know, maybe suggestion,

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:01.410
I'll call it, that from
Harvey Kietel's character

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.540
who plays Agent Sadusky.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.100
Our characters kind of interact

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.570
and he tells her that a necklace

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.580
that she's had her whole life maybe

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.920
has something to do with this
great Pan-American treasure.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:13.980
And even more her father might
have something to do with it.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.000
And for Jess, she's never

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.320
had a relationship with her father.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:19.800
So she's kind of at this point
in her life wanting to search

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:23.940
for familial ties, something
that will ground her again

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.590
so she decides to go after it.

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:26.650
- Yeah.

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:28.170
- It's a great, it's a great adventure.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:29.003
- I know.

00:02:29.003 --> 00:02:29.880
That's what I love about, like,

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.340
I love about the movies is
it takes you on this ride

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.300
like you were saying.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.190
And I'm so excited about the series

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:36.330
except for whenever it ends

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.410
and you have to wait for the next episode.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:38.850
But like, but then,
but it's like, it's one

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:39.840
of those things that's so exciting

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.340
because you go on the adventure

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.450
and you get to figure out the clues, like

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:43.320
with all the characters.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.120
It's such a clever way to make a series

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.310
'cause everybody wants to keep watching.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.990
How did you find out you got the part?

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.220
Like I heard it was a big deal.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:51.630
Right?
- It was a huge deal.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.463
- Yeah.

00:02:52.463 --> 00:02:54.720
- So I actually had like a
really tedious audition process.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.480
It was about, gosh, I wanna
say about a month long.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.580
And I had, I'd done, you know,

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.490
I was auditioning every
single day, many scenes.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.770
And I was at that point where I was like

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:05.970
are they gonna tell me or not?

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:06.930
I was so stressed.
- Yeah.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.750
- And my mom was like,
let's just go shopping.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.820
Like let's just go shopping,
distract ourselves.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.950
And so I'm like, yes, I love shopping.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:14.783
Let's go shopping.

00:03:14.783 --> 00:03:15.810
Let's just, you know, do it.

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.880
- [Kelly] De-stress.
- Yes, exactly.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.500
And so we're in this changing room

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:22.200
to a store that I guess
just has zero reception

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.120
and like, I'm changing and everything.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.440
All of a sudden my phone just starts going

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.750
ding, ding, ding, ding,
ding, ding, ding, ding.

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:28.590
And I'm like, (gasps)

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:29.423
Oh my God.

00:03:29.423 --> 00:03:30.390
I look at it, it's my manager

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.940
And she's telling me like,
call me back right now.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.250
I'm like, oh my god Mama, this is it.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.090
This is it.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.020
I don't know what I'm gonna do.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.120
I'm like trying to change
back into my clothes.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:39.960
I'm like giving her the clothes.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:40.920
She's like, do I stand in line?

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.753
What do I do?

00:03:41.753 --> 00:03:43.230
I was like, I don't know,
but I gotta go take the call.

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:45.240
I like go outside into the

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.340
to the alley or the hallway area

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.200
where like all the benches are.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.633
Oh my god, that's me. (laughs)

00:03:51.633 --> 00:03:52.843
(audience clapping)

00:03:52.843 --> 00:03:53.684
Yeah.

00:03:53.684 --> 00:03:55.242
(Kelly screaming)

00:03:55.242 --> 00:03:57.270
Yeah it's like where I
summon my dad to go sit.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.740
And so eventually I took the call,

00:03:58.740 --> 00:03:59.730
I found out I got the part

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.200
and I just like immediately remember

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.060
like I start jumping up and down crying.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.130
My mom noticed from inside the store.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:06.660
She didn't care, she ran out.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:07.707
Without the clothes, of course.

00:04:07.707 --> 00:04:08.550
(audience laughing)

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:09.383
Yeah.

00:04:09.383 --> 00:04:10.770
And yeah, we just celebrated that day.

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:11.610
It was amazing.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:12.720
It was what we least expected.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:13.553
- Oh my God.

00:04:13.553 --> 00:04:14.730
Well I just, I saw that video

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.010
and it just made me like
smile on the inside.

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.540
Like never lose that joy.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.310
Like such a beautiful thing to feel

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.170
that kind of like energy off something

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:23.250
that you've worked for.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.270
Like, and it's happening.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:25.223
It's really cool.

00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:26.056
- Aw, thanks so much.

00:04:26.056 --> 00:04:27.180
- I'm so glad you shared it with everyone.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.630
It's such a beautiful moment.

